    <string name="public_title">Use free public configs?</string>
    <string name="public_warning">Nobody knows who runs these servers. They can see your IP address and which sites you open, and any of them could be run by someone watching its users. Use them to get online and for ordinary browsing, not for logins, banking or anything sensitive.</string>
