    <!-- 0.4.0: Free WARP, speed, subscriptions, QR -->
    <string name="warp_name">Free WARP</string>
    <string name="warp_badge">Free</string>
    <string name="warp_hint">Cloudflare WARP, no config or subscription needed. Bridge finds a way through your network each time you connect, which can take up to a minute. Sites see a Cloudflare address, and some of them ask for a captcha.</string>
    <string name="warp_use">Use</string>
    <string name="warp_in_use">In use</string>
    <string name="warp_method">Connection method</string>
    <string name="warp_auto">Auto: fastest</string>
    <string name="warp_foreign">Exit outside Iran</string>
    <string name="warp_psiphon">WARP + Psiphon</string>
    <string name="warp_auto_hint">Tries every fast way at once and keeps the fastest that works. The exit is usually registered in Iran: filtering is bypassed, but sites that block Iranian users may refuse.</string>
    <string name="warp_foreign_hint">Also tries two ways with two hops and waits for them, because their exit is outside Iran. Connecting takes longer, up to a minute, and the speed is lower. If neither gets through it connects another way, with an exit in Iran, and for half an hour doesn\'t wait for them.</string>
    <string name="warp_psiphon_hint">WARP from Iran usually exits in Iran. Psiphon, carried inside WARP, leaves from another country, so sites that refuse Iranian users open. It is slower, connecting takes up to a minute and a half longer, and calls and games that use UDP may not work. The traffic passes through the Psiphon network.</string>
    <string name="warp_region">Exit country</string>
    <string name="warp_region_any">Any country</string>
    <string name="warp_unavailable">Free WARP needs Android 10 or newer.</string>
    <string name="warp_psiphon_failed">Psiphon didn\'t connect through WARP within a minute and a half. Choose another connection method to use WARP alone.</string>
    <string name="warp_no_account">Free WARP could not create a WARP account, because Cloudflare\'s WARP service is blocked on this network right now. Try again later or on another network.</string>
    <string name="warp_no_way">Free WARP found no way through this network right now. The details are in Logs.</string>
    <string name="warp_died">WARP stopped unexpectedly. The details are in Logs.</string>
